  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12efb4e91f50acd42999f69a91d76dab, type: 3}
  m_Name: ClearDemons1_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 02a1fc921f4037d4bb7357b2fa36c700, type: 2}
    text: "Xong r\u1ed3i, t\xf4i ngh\u0129 \u0111\u1ea5y l\xe0 con cu\u1ed1i c\xf9ng r\u1ed3i \u0111\u1ea5y."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cdfbdabbf8285304690416cec3c5c792, type: 2}
    text: "H\u1ed9c, h\u1ed9c... (th\u1edf d\u1ed1c) ...C\u0169ng may l\xe0 c\xf2n s\u1ed1ng. Vi\u1ec7c di chuy\u1ec3n li\xean t\u1ee5c m\u1ec7t qu\xe1 \u0111i. T\xf4i ki\u1ec7t s\u1ee9c r\u1ed3i."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 02a1fc921f4037d4bb7357b2fa36c700, type: 2}
    text: "C\u0169ng ph\u1ea3i ha, t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1edbi gi\u1edd c\u1eadu ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ngh\u1ec9 ng\u01a1i. Ch\xfang ta v\u1ec1 l\u1ea1i h\u1ea7m tr\xfa \u1ea9n \u0111\u1ec3 th\xf4ng b\xe1o cho h\u1ecd r\u1ed3i ngh\u1ec9 ng\u01a1i \u0111i."
